  <section class="section">
    <div class="timeline">
      <article><time>V1 WEBSITE</time><h3>RetroGuy VN web foundation</h3><p>Astro-based public site prepared for Cloudflare deployment and future backend services.</p></article>
      <article><time>NEXT</time><h3>Product media integration</h3><p>Replace V1 placeholders with final product renders, screenshots and launch-facing content.</p></article>
      <article><time>PLANNED</time><h3>Connected services</h3><p>Device registration, OTA, cloud save and online PvP will be introduced as independent service phases.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
